#: eb61067d12fb4a4ea46f44d706f8ca64
msgid ""
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh vr\n"
msgstr ""
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh vr\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:162
#: 3453b499f041402bb1a61b610a839f5d
msgid "Pico Enterprise vs consumer"
msgstr "Pico 企业版与消费版"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:165
#: 1aa6b17f62844b23a3a7b73d91c4a4d2
msgid ""
"Pico **Enterprise** and Pico **consumer** are different SKUs: Enterprise "
"supports USB 网络共享 and uses a **different App**. Install the App that "
"matches the headset edition."
msgstr ""
"Pico **企业版** 与 Pico **消费版** 是不同 SKU：企业版支持 USB 网络共享，并使用**不同的 "
"App**。不要为两者安装同一个 App。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:168
#: 3d99b44687bf45e2bd6baa559db58332
msgid "Isomorphic Teleop (HighTorque Panthera HT)"
msgstr "同构遥操作（高擎 Panthera HT）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:170
#: e76c1593e01d4355b5baeb07eee15ef1
msgid ""
"Master–slave **isomorphic teleop** (同构遥操作). On the `panthera-ht` branch, "
"real-robot teleop is `./teleop_start.sh` — see [HighTorque Panthera "
"HT](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md). Mock "
"(package README):"
msgstr ""
"主从 **同构遥操作**。在 `panthera-ht` 分支上，真机遥操作是 `./teleop_start.sh` — 见 [高擎 "
"Panthera "
"HT](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)。模拟（软件包 "
"README）："

