msgstr "新手路径之后"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:229
#: 6fcbc58f66374ad283baa03e5ede41eb
msgid ""
"Continue by **role** in [More "
"applications](../6-more_applications/0-index.md): field commissioning "
"(现场调试), classical algorithm (传统方案算法工程师), VLA collect / train / deploy "
"(VLA 采训推), simulation (仿真工程师)."
msgstr ""
"按 **角色** 继续看[更多应用](../6-more_applications/0-index.md)：现场调试、传统方案算法工程师、VLA "
"采训推、仿真工程师。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:231
#: 8509895a341d4e84abb3d801adce3512
msgid "Tips for Success"
msgstr "实用建议"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:233
#: c9f0c07a397442f4a71c4c795af981b2
msgid ""
"**Don't skip mock mode** — Always verify behavior in mock before "
"simulation or real hardware"
msgstr "**不要跳过 mock 模式** — 在进入仿真或真实硬件之前，务必先在 mock 中验证行为"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:234
#: 94f5a8e24919402393f84a60cb4731d5
msgid ""
"**Read the warnings** — The stack logs helpful messages about "
"configuration issues"
msgstr "**阅读警告信息** — 技术栈会记录有助于排查配置问题的日志"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:235
#: d1b8ec2765334f3db1018f48b6bc702d
msgid ""
"**Use lean branches** — `open-deploy-ws` offers `dobot-cr5`, `arx-"
"lift2s`, and `panthera-ht`"
msgstr "**使用精简分支** — `open-deploy-ws` 提供 `dobot-cr5`、`arx-lift2s` 和 `panthera-ht`"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:236
#: 85e20ecd67024775961d12acd9145334
